    "title": "Looking for Store Manager at Nippon Paint Store Holdings Services",
    "description": "If you're a passionate Store Manager with drive and ambition, Nippon Paint Store Holdings Services in Ranchi is the place for you. We're growing fast and need talented people to grow with us.\n\nAbout Nippon Paint Store Holdings Services:\nNippon Paint Store Holdings Services is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Handle customer queries, complaints, and escalations effectively\n• Coordinate with the supply chain team for timely stock delivery\n• Assist in recruiting, onboarding, and performance management of staff\n• Ensure visual merchandising standards are maintained at all times\n• Maintain high standards of store hygiene and cleanliness\n• Build relationships with regular customers to drive loyalty\n• Prepare daily sales reports and share insights with management\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• MBBS / MD / MS from recognized medical college\n• 10-15 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Retail Operations\n• Proficiency in Team Leadership\n• Proficiency in Loyalty Programs\n• Proficiency in SAP Retail\n• Proficiency in KPI Management\n• Proficiency in Omnichannel Retail\n• Proficiency in Loss Prevention\n• Proficiency in MS Excel\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Professional development and training programs\n• International travel opportunities for senior roles\n• Annual paid leaves and casual leaves\n• Referral bonus program\n• Meal coupons and food allowance\n• Company-sponsored certifications\n• Salary Range: 20 LPA - 40 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Ranchi, Jharkhand, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Nippon Paint Store Holdings Services!",
